Subject: [PATCH] fixup! chain: add a placeholder Lotus V2 genesis for mainnet
 and testnet

Re-root the seven existing testnet header fixtures at the actual new genesis and independently mine their real BLAKE3 proof of work. Retain every timestamp, header body, height, size and branch shape. Independently verify ASERT accepts main heights1..4 and fork1..2 but rejects main5 bad-diffbits. Genesis+1 uses the existing17-bit powLimit anchor; no network difficulty or rejection rule changes.

Tier: V2 (fixup to chain(v2): replace placeholder genesis blocks with Lotus V2 genesis blocks)
